      "widgets_values": [
        "Seedance 2.5",
        0,
        0,
        0,
        "Follow Video 1 exactly for motion, timing, blocking and camera movement. Keep the same framing from start to finish, with no added zooms, cuts or close-ups. Use Video 1 for motion only, not for its look. Re-render the scene to match the reference images or description.\n\nCinematic, photoreal, shot on film. Natural, motivated lighting that fits the scene, with film grain and realistic texture.\n\nAvoid: changing the motion or framing, added zooms or cuts, letterbox bars, a CGI or digital look.",
